<title>USA: Erox makes executive changes.</title>
<headline>Erox makes executive changes.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Erox Corp said on Tuesday William Horgan has been named chairman.</p>
<p>Horgan retains his responsibilities as chief executive officer while his position as president will now be taken by Michael Stern, who has been promoted from the marketing department where he was vice president.</p>
<p>Erox said in a statement it will also be searching for several other key executives to aid in the expansion of its fragrance and related business. Erox is a maker of perfumes.</p>
</text>
